              <div class="review-item__text">
                <p><em>I just did my second oil change since putting my AFM disabler in. I recovered 5 full quarts. When I first got this truck I was alarmed to have only recovered roughly 3 1/2 quarts. It's clearly cut down on oil consumption significantly. Highly recommend this device to anybody."</em></p>
              </div><div class="review-item__author">
                  <em>James N.</em> 
